Z||000002||Old Lar||10-25-2001||07:42 AM||||Cost will depend on who does it and what you want done and the amount of repairs to the body that are needed or whether you want a panel off paint job.<P>Rattle can $50<BR>Maacco $300<BR>Good job $3500 panel off repaint.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||10-25-2001||06:35 PM||||I was just quoted $3500 for a panel on respray of the original color.  I know I can get a decent (if not show quality) paint job for less than that.  Seems like I was quoted around $2500 to repaint the Grape Ape (pearlized purple) about a year ago.  If they can do that for $2500, they should be able to repaint my car for less than $2000.||||reg||1
