Z||000005||rogergarrison||10-25-2001||07:51 PM||||you ought to be able to get a quality job for $1500-$1800. may have to pay a little more to get jams or 2 tone. Pearls usually only add maybe $50 to an all over. Its just an added couple of light coats under the clear.||||reg||1
